<div class="ct-posts-shortcode" data-prefix="blog"><div class="entries" data-archive="default" data-layout="grid" data-cards="boxed"><article class="entry-card card-content post-11318 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-dog-parent-tips category-dog-health-and-safety" ><a class="ct-media-container boundless-image" href="https://www.therulybully.com/are-petunias-safe-for-dogs/" aria-label="Are Petunias Toxic To Dogs?"><img decoding="async" width="600" height="338" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='600'%20height='338'%20viewBox='0%200%20600%20338'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-post-image perfmatters-lazy" alt="Tan pitbull smelling pink and purple petunias on a grey deck" style="aspect-ratio: 16/9;" title="are petunias safe for dogs featured image" data-src="https://www.therulybully.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Are-Petunias-Safe-For-Dogs-Featured-Image-600x338.webp" data-srcset="https://www.therulybully.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Are-Petunias-Safe-For-Dogs-Featured-Image-600x338.webp 600w, https://www.therulybully.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Are-Petunias-Safe-For-Dogs-Featured-Image-900x507.webp 900w, https://www.therulybully.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Are-Petunias-Safe-For-Dogs-Featured-Image-768x432.webp 768w, https://www.therulybully.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Are-Petunias-Safe-For-Dogs-Featured-Image.webp 1200w" data-sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" /></a><h2 class="entry-title"><a href="https://www.therulybully.com/are-petunias-safe-for-dogs/" rel="bookmark">Are Petunias Toxic To Dogs?</a></h2><div class="entry-excerpt"><p>Are petunias safe for dogs? We'll take you through their safety, risks, and just enough background info that you can make your own decision.</p>
